# Leaks LeakSanitizer finds in libraries this project does not build.
#
# fontconfig parses fonts.conf through expat the first time FcInit runs, and
# its parser loses two blocks on the way (320 bytes in Debian 13's 2.16.0).
# Nothing points at them afterwards, so FcFini would not free them either.
leak:FcInitLoadConfigAndFonts
